        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW1SMTSBR, Elegant Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by First Impressions, this Elegant Door Pull is part of the Delaware Collection, known for its traditional style and beautiful design. It is available in 18 inch or 24 inch lengths with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. Versatile, the Elegant Delaware Door Pull can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLW1SMTSBR Delaware Front Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CF8301S-STR-detail.jpg?v=1704354522\"><b>First Impressions DLW1SMTSBR Detailed View</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW03-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262278\"><b>First Impressions DLW1SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLW1018SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLW1024SMTSBR</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.46\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths and Finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door pull, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Elegant Door Pull",
                "description": "Made by First Impressions, this Elegant Door Pull is part of the Delaware Collection, known for its traditional style and beautiful design. It is available in 18 inch or 24 inch lengths with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. Versatile, the Elegant Delaware Door Pull can be mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. \r\n",
